{"ID":"20240205153741-4hu2q84","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153741-4hu2q84","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153741-4hu2q84\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206082715-ca3ev73\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612164743-o2ssqwz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:800\u0026#125;","title":"265乌头（川乌头）","type":"doc","updated":"20240822095923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206082732-72wx6iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082732-72wx6iw","updated":"20240206082738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t为不规则圆锥形，稍弯曲，顶端常有残茎，中部多向一侧膨大，长27.5cm，直径1.22.5cm。表面棕褐色或灰棕色，皱缩，有小瘤状侧根及子根痕。质坚实，断面类白色或浅灰黄色，形成层环多角形。气微，味辛辣、麻舌。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，热，有大毒。\n【功效】\t祛风除湿；温经；散寒止痛。主风寒湿痹；关节疼痛；肢体麻木；半身不遂；头风头痛；心腹冷痛；寒疝作痛；跌打瘀痛；阴疽肿毒；并可用于麻醉止痛 。\n【注解】\t“乌鸦头”：指川乌或者草乌的根，形状像乌鸦的头。\n“钉角”：指川乌表面的小瘤状侧根和子根痕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206082741-fxrspa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082741-fxrspa5","updated":"20240206082743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206082741-s7gcbez.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240627170147-gcgewmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627170147-gcgewmr","updated":"20240627170152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627170147-um6kjzc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627170055-e577pej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627170055-e577pej","updated":"20240627170251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627165830-8uiuubv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627170251-ce1ldo6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724130820-j8ahzp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724130820-j8ahzp3","updated":"20240724131041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 527px;","style":"width: 517px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌-20240724131039-l52pr8l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 517px;\" parent-style=\"width: 527px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627164606-nvsvcg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627164606-nvsvcg7","updated":"20240724131056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 356px;","style":"width: 346px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240724130912-0mfrcfh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 346px;\" parent-style=\"width: 356px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子-20240627164606-flau994.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 536px;","style":"width: 526px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子4-20240627164906-ar8iu9m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 526px;\" parent-style=\"width: 536px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822095923-4z90ap6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822095923-4z90ap6","updated":"20240822095923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 418px;","style":"width: 408px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 6-20240724132427-tb1poin.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 408px;\" parent-style=\"width: 418px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 9-20240724132832-cxxvrnk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619182307-ofvcuz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619182307-ofvcuz0","updated":"20240724132343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子2-20240627164649-vxu80wj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619182307-i0rz9nm.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 5-20240724132343-qysc350.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724132643-eqxdl41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724132643-eqxdl41","updated":"20240724133447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 833px;","style":"width: 823px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627165647-2itbuyq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 823px;\" parent-style=\"width: 833px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 357px;","style":"width: 347px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 4-20240724132006-fxxd1lw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 347px;\" parent-style=\"width: 357px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724131431-ec0izi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724131431-ec0izi9","updated":"20240724131817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 1-20240724131431-4kx6gl2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川乌 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川乌 2-20240724131817-9xa407l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724130751-xoortfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724130751-xoortfz","updated":"20240724133243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1098px;","style":"width: 1088px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子-20240724133243-jfvcvmd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1088px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1098px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627164943-jklinf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627164943-jklinf6","updated":"20240627164951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 465px;","style":"width: 455px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子6-20240627164943-dlt5r0x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 455px;\" parent-style=\"width: 465px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 742px;","style":"width: 732px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"附子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/附子3-20240627164746-t9cj01f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 732px;\" parent-style=\"width: 742px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724125136-t3z6z9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724125136-t3z6z9z","updated":"20240724125336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：川乌有剧毒，请再专业人士指导下使用；"}]},{"ID":"20240724125131-hu3ltrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724125131-hu3ltrf","updated":"20240724125134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：川乌和草乌相比，川乌是直立的多年生草本，而草乌则是藤蔓植物（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"草乌是先直立，后爬蔓；大概在长到50公分之前，它是直立的，杆比较硬，随着周围植物长高，他就变成爬蔓缠绕其它植物生长"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240724125223-ylrrkmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724125223-ylrrkmw","updated":"20240724133329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：川乌和草乌都有剧毒，川乌一定处理后可内用，而草乌多为外用，如内服需制过；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240206082126-xytdwdf","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"草乌（草乌头、北乌头）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164509-5fsq3en","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164509-5fsq3en"}},{"ID":"20240612164510-abt0lln","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-abt0lln","updated":"20240612164515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-jt6fuqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-jt6fuqg","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-azsra7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-azsra7n","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主中风，恶风，洗洗，出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚，寒热。其汁煎之，名射罔，杀禽兽。一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-z7s22o9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-z7s22o9","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：乌头，一名莨，一名千狄，一名毒公，一名卑负（《御览》作果负），一名耿子，神农雷公桐君黄帝甘有毒，正月始生。叶厚、茎方、中空，叶四四相当，与蒿相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-ylsonmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-ylsonmf","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又云：乌喙，神农雷公桐君黄帝有毒，李氏小寒，十月采，形如乌头，有两岐相合，如乌之喙，名曰乌喙也，所畏恶使，尽与乌头同，一名萴子，一名莨，神农岐伯有大毒，李氏大寒，八月采，阴干。是附子角之大者，畏恶与附子同。（《御览》，《大观本》节文）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-sy3ynoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-sy3ynoa","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生朗陵，正月二月采，阴干，长三寸，已上为天雄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164510-zpgcyjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164510-zpgcyjt","updated":"20240612164510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按《说文》云：萴，乌喙也。《尔雅》云：芨，堇草。郭璞云：即乌头也，江东呼为堇。《范子计然》云：乌头出三辅中，白者善。国语云：骊姬置堇于肉。韦昭云：堇，乌头也。《淮南子》主术训云：莫凶于鸡毒。高诱云：鸡毒，乌头也，按鸡毒即奚毒，即子，即萴子侧子也，《名医》别出侧子条，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164407-p237vor","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164407-p237vor"}},{"ID":"20240612164459-qbdrx96","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-qbdrx96","updated":"20240612164504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-ba4t5md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-ba4t5md","updated":"20240612164459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘、温、大热，有大毒。主中风，恶风，洗洗出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚寒热。消胸上痰冷，食不下，心腹冷疾，脐间痛，肩胛痛不可俯仰，目中痛不可力视。又堕禽兽。射罔，味苦，有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-qgohayd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-qgohayd","updated":"20240612164459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗尸疰症坚，及头中风痹痛。一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。乌喙，味辛，微温，有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-too39py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-too39py","updated":"20240612164459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风湿，丈夫肾湿，阴囊痒，寒热历节，掣引腰痛，不能步行，痈肿脓结。又堕胎。生朗陵川谷。正月、二月采，阴干。长三寸以上为天雄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-zpykdcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-zpykdcb","updated":"20240612164459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莽草为之使，反半夏、栝蒌、贝母、白蔹、白芨，恶藜芦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-n3kjicy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-n3kjicy","updated":"20240612164459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今采用四月乌头与附子同根，春状如牛角，名乌喙，喙即鸟之口也〔谨案也。此物同苗或有三歧者，然两歧者少。纵天雄、附子有两歧者，仍依本名。如乌头有两歧，即名乌喙，天雄、附子若有两歧者，复云何名之？"}]},{"ID":"20240612164459-swrvf7g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164459-swrvf7g"}},{"ID":"20240612164520-8ha94dk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-8ha94dk","updated":"20240612164526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-jhleaqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-jhleaqs","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」乌喙、草乌头、土附子、奚毒、耿子、毒公、金鸦。苗名：莨、芨、堇、独白草、鸳鸯菊。汁煎名射罔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-w2rsua2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-w2rsua2","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（乌头）辛、温、有大毒。（乌喙，一名两头尖）辛、微温、有大毒。（射罔）苦、有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-inhoysg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-inhoysg","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-hn9b37p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-hn9b37p","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、中风瘫痪（手中颤动，言语蹇涩）用草乌头（炮，去皮）四两，川乌头（炮，去皮）二两，乳香、没药各一两，共研为末；生乌豆一升，以斑蝥三至七个，去头翅，同煮豆熟，取豆，焙干为末，加入上述药末中，以醋、面调成丸子，如梧子大，每服三十丸，温酒送下。此方名“左经丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-282w53u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-282w53u","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、瘫痪顽负（风节疼痛，下元虚冷，一切风疮）。用草乌头、川乌头、两头尖各三钱，硫磺、麝香、丁香各一钱，木鳖子五个，共研为末。再以熟艾揉软，合在一起用草纸包裹。烧熏痛处。此方名“雷丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-7h7nmwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-7h7nmwv","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、腰脚冷痛。用乌头三个，去皮脐，研细，醋调贴痛处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-cupykwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-cupykwi","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、久患头风。用草乌头尖（生）一分、赤小豆三十五粒、麝香二分，共研为末。每服半钱，冷薄荷汤送上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-qp76o91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-qp76o91","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、耳鸣耳痒（耳中如闻流乐声及风声，不治成聋）用新掘得的生乌头，乘湿削如枣核大，塞耳内。一天换二次，几天病愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-fq20o3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-fq20o3p","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、喉痹口噤。用草乌头、皂荚，等分为末，加麝香少许擦牙，并吸入鼻内，牙关自开，又方：用草乌尖、石胆，等分为末，每用一钱，以醋煮皂荚的液汁调稀，扫涂肿上，流涎几次，其毒即破。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-t2xbx9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-t2xbx9f","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、脾、寒、厥疟（先寒后热，名寒疟；但寒不热，面色黑者名厥疟；寒多热少，百黄腹痛，脾疟）用上等草乌头削去皮，开水泡几次，密盖一段时间，取出切细、焙干，研为末，加猛然糊做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，清早服，以姜十片，枣三枚、葱三根煎汤送下，隔一、两小时再服药一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-360u57h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-360u57h","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、腹中症结。用射罔二两、椒三百粒，共捣为末，加鸡蛋白和成丸子，如麻子大。每服一丸，渐至三丸，病愈为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-n56pyyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-n56pyyl","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、内痔不出。用生草乌头切片，加醋熬成膏，摊贴患处，次日即可把根拔出。又方：两头尖一两、巴豆四个，捣烂贴患睡，疔自拔出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-vbht6hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-vbht6hj","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、疔毒恶肿。用生草乌头切片，加醋熬成膏，摊贴患处，次日即可把根拔出。又方：两头尖一两、巴豆四个，捣烂贴患处，疔自拔出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-n2p62uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-n2p62uc","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、遍身生疮（阴囊及两脚最多）。用草乌头一两，盐一两，化水泡一夜，炒红，研为末；另取猪腰子一个，去膜煨熟。竹刀切细、捣烂，加醋、糊调药末为丸，如绿豆在。每服三十丸，空心服，盐汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164520-uef9aad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164520-uef9aad","updated":"20240612164520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、瘰疬初起（未破，发寒发热）。用草乌头头半两、木鳖子二个，加米醋磨细，再投入捣烂的葱头和蝗蚓粪少许，调匀敷患处，外贴纸条，留通气孔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164759-wekbm2t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164759-wekbm2t"}},{"ID":"20240612164801-c31j501","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164801-c31j501","updated":"20240612164807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164801-cj8mg9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164801-cj8mg9p","updated":"20240612164801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。主中风恶风。洗洗出汗。除寒湿痹。咳逆上气。破积聚寒热。其汁煎之名射罔。杀禽兽。一名奚毒。一名即子。一名乌喙。生山谷。（今草乌头）如饴咏堇。头喙分名。橐藏毒用。箭敷锋迎。谗姬置肉。奇士扬觥。法穷酿造。不事锄耕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164801-3hnag9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164801-3hnag9d","updated":"20240612164801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器曰。一名堇。诗。堇荼如饴。吴普曰。形如乌之头。有两歧相合。如乌之喙。是附子角之大者。淮南子曰。天下之物。莫凶于鸡毒。良医橐而藏之。有所用也。陶弘景曰。捣汁敷箭。射禽兽十步即倒。汪机曰。锋锐捷利。国语。骊姬置堇于肉。明皇十七事。上谓力士曰。吾闻饮堇汁不死者。乃奇士也。以汁进。张果饮进二卮。醇然如醉。李时珍曰。根苗花实。与川乌头同。此系野生。无酿造之法。杨天惠记。附子之田。岁以善田。一再耕之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164813-9wrihvg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164813-9wrihvg"}},{"ID":"20240612164814-p33nzjg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164814-p33nzjg","updated":"20240612164818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164814-8hm69lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164814-8hm69lk","updated":"20240612164814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，温、大热，有大毒。主治中风，恶风洗洗，出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚，寒热。消胸上痰冷，食不下，心腹冷疾，脐间痛，肩胛痛不可俯仰，目中痛不可力视，又堕胎。其汁∶煎之名射罔，杀禽兽。射罔，味苦，有大毒。治尸疰症坚，及头中风，痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164814-g5f3wsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164814-g5f3wsn","updated":"20240612164814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。乌喙，味辛，微温，有大毒。主风湿，丈夫肾湿，阴囊痒，寒热历节，掣引腰痛，不能步行，痈肿脓结。又堕胎。生朗陵川谷。正月、二月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164814-z2yiweb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164814-z2yiweb","updated":"20240612164814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长三寸以上为天雄。（莽草为之使，反半夏、栝蒌、贝母、白蔹、白芨，恶藜芦。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164814-5v4e53t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164814-5v4e53t","updated":"20240612164814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今采用四月乌头与附子同根，春时茎初生有脑形似乌鸟之头，故谓之乌头，有两岐共蒂，状如牛角，名乌喙，喙即鸟之口也。亦以八月采，捣榨茎取汁，日煎为射罔，猎人以傅箭射禽兽，中人亦死，宜速解之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164553-hw6ff0z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164553-hw6ff0z"}},{"ID":"20240612164554-5xo1rus","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164554-5xo1rus","updated":"20240612164559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164554-8mip3ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164554-8mip3ty","updated":"20240612164554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，温，大热，有大毒。主中风，恶风，洗洗出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气寒热，消胸上痰，冷食不下，心腹冷疾，脐间痛，肩胛痛不可俯仰，目中痛不可久胎，其汁煎之名射罔，味苦，有大毒。疗尸疰，症坚及头中风痹痛。杀∶禽兽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164554-obcltdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164554-obcltdc","updated":"20240612164554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"云∶使。远志为之使。忌∶豉汁。味苦辛，大热，有大毒。能治恶风憎寒，湿痹痰包心，肠腹 痛， 癖气块。益阳事，中风，洗洗恶寒，除寒热，主胸中痰满下食。治咳逆上气，治齿痛，破积聚寒，主强志。日华子云∶土附子，味 辛，生去皮，捣滤汁澄清，旋添晒干取膏，名为射罔，猎人将作毒箭使用。或中者，以青、小豆叶、浮萍、冷水、荠 ，皆可御之。莽草为之使。反∶半夏、栝蒌、贝母白芨。恶∶藜芦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164605-80v9nri","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164605-80v9nri"}},{"ID":"20240612164606-cx7eyq5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-cx7eyq5","updated":"20240612164609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-agz99fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-agz99fg","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经下品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-rpgb2po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-rpgb2po","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头功力，能生死人。非以生气通之者，孰能与此。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-lcgulh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-lcgulh6","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛温，有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-2hxh48x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-2hxh48x","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主中风恶风，洗洗汗出，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚寒热。其汁煎之名射罔，杀"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-lwmigs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-lwmigs1","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶乌头与附子同种，盖初化之形物也。近取野生者，别无酿造之法。唯多历年月，则气力勇悍，其毒转甚。处处有之，苗叶花实，并类川乌，根外黑内白，皱而枯燥。酉阳杂俎云∶雀芋，状如雀头，置干地，地反湿，湿地地反干，飞鸟触之堕，走兽遇之僵。一曰乌草，即乌头之野生者。修事，用文武火中炮令皱折，劈破用。莽草为之使，反半夏、栝蒌、贝母、白蔹、白芨。恶藜芦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164606-mga2rwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164606-mga2rwo","updated":"20240612164606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶乌，日魄也。兼天雄附侧之阳而首出之，命曰乌头。经云∶阳气者，若天与日，是故阳因而上卫外者也。故主中风恶风，汗出洗洗，致卫气散解者，力堪卫外而为固者也。寒湿合痹，致咳逆上气；积聚寒热，致内闭不通，外壅肌肉者，力主俾通而起亟之。先人云∶人病有四，曰痹、风、痿、厥，乌力唯宣痹、风。阳行有四，曰升、降、出、入，乌力唯从升、出。但阳喜独行，而专操杀业，在刚愎人所当禁忌。又云∶有家莳，有野生。野生无人气，无理法，与生人反，鸟兽不可与同群，一味草乌而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164521-mwrz8il","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164521-mwrz8il"}},{"ID":"20240612164532-q2iq70y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-q2iq70y","updated":"20240612164539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-z9mozc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-z9mozc5","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，温、大热，有大毒。主中风恶风，洗洗出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚寒热，消胸上痰冷，食不下，心腹冷疾，脐间痛，肩胛痛，不可俯仰，目中痛，不可久视。又堕胎。其汁煎之，名射罔，杀禽兽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-e6g2a7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-e6g2a7s","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"射罔 味苦，有大毒。疗尸疰症坚，及头中风痹痛。一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-2r0ukzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-2r0ukzi","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按中蛊通用药云∶射罔，温，大热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-h5mhwnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-h5mhwnk","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌喙（音讳） 味辛，微温，有大毒。主风湿，丈夫肾湿阴囊痒，寒热历节，制引腰痛，不能行步，痈肿脓结。又堕胎。生朗陵山谷，正月、二月采，阴干。长三寸以上为天雄。（莽草为之使，反半夏、栝蒌、贝母、白蔹、白芨、恶藜芦。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-oe6uzjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-oe6uzjn","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今采用四月乌头与附子同根，春时茎初生。有脑形似乌鸟之头，故谓之乌头。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-akz2szx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-akz2szx","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有两歧，共蒂状如牛角，名乌喙。喙即乌之口也。亦以八月采，捣笮茎取汁，日煎为射罔。猎人以敷箭，射禽兽，中人亦死，宜速解之。唐本注云∶乌喙，即乌头异名也。此物同苗，或有三歧者，然两歧者少。纵夫雄、附子有两歧者，仍根据本名。如乌头两歧，即名乌喙，天雄、附子若有两歧者，复云何名之？臣禹锡等谨按吴氏云∶乌头一名莨，一名千秋，一名毒公，一名果负，一名耿子。神农、雷公、桐君、黄帝∶甘，有毒。正月始生，叶浓，茎方中空，叶四四相当，与蒿相似。又云乌喙，神农、雷公、桐君、黄帝∶有毒。十月采。形如乌头，有两歧，相合如乌之喙，名曰马喙也。所畏、恶、使，尽与乌头同。尔雅云∶芨，董草。注∶即乌头也，江东呼为堇（音靳）。崔实四民月令云∶三月可采乌头。药性论云∶乌头，使，远志为之使，忌豉汁，味苦、辛，大热，有大毒。能治恶风憎寒，湿痹逆气，冷痰包心，肠腹痛， 癖气块，益阳事，中风洗洗恶寒，除寒热，主胸中痰满，冷气，不下食，治咳逆上气，治齿痛，破积聚寒，主强志。又云乌喙，使，忌豉汁，味苦、辛，大热。能治男子肾气衰弱，阴汗，主疗风温湿邪痛，治寒热痈肿岁月不消者。陈藏器云∶射罔本功外。主疮，疮根结核，瘰 ，毒肿及蛇咬。先取药涂肉四畔，渐渐近疮，习习逐病至骨。疮有熟脓及黄水出，涂之。若无脓水，有生血，及新伤肉破，即不可涂，立杀人。亦如杀走兽，敷箭镞射之，十步倒也。日华子云∶土附子，味 、辛，热，有毒。生去皮，捣滤汁澄清，旋添，晒干取膏，名为射罔。猎人将作毒箭使用，或中者，以甘草、蓝青、小豆叶、浮萍，冷水、荠，皆可御也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-etevhp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-etevhp9","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具侧子条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-4mieker","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-4mieker","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣惠方∶治风，腰脚冷痹疼痛。用川乌头三分去皮脐。生捣罗，酽醋调涂于故帛上敷之，须臾痛止。又方∶治久疥癣方∶用川乌头七枚，生用捣碎，以水三大盏，煎至一大盏，去滓，温洗之。外台秘要∶治头风头痛。腊月乌头一升，炒令黄，末之，绢袋盛，酒三升浸，温服。千金方∶治耳鸣如流水声，耳痒及风声，不治久成聋。全乌头一味，掘得承湿削如枣核大，塞耳。旦易夜易，不过三日愈。又方∶治沙虱毒，以射罔敷之佳。经验方∶治一切冷气，去风痰，定遍身疼痛。益元气，强精力，固精益髓，令人少病。川乌头一斤，用五升许大瓷钵子盛，以童子小便浸，逐日添注任令溢出，浸二七日，其乌头通软，拣去烂坏者不用，余以竹刀切破，每个作四片，却用新汲井水淘七遍后浸之，每日换。七日通前浸二十一日，取出焙干，其药洁白，捣罗为末，酒煮面糊丸绿豆大。每服十丸，空心盐汤，酒下，少粥饭压之。如冷气稍盛，加丸数服之。经验后方∶治痢独圣丸∶川乌头一个好者，柴灰火烧烟欲尽取出，地上盏子合，良久，细研，用酒，蜡丸如大麻子，每服三丸。赤痢用黄连、甘草、黑豆煎汤放冷吞下；如白，用甘草、黑豆煎汤放冷吞下；如泻及肚疼，水吞下。每于空心服之，忌热物。梅师方∶治蛇虺螫人，以射罔涂螫处，频易。又方∶治妇人血风虚冷，月候不匀，或即脚手心烦热，或头面浮肿顽麻。川乌头一斤，清油四两，盐四两，一处铛内熬令裂。如桑椹色为度，去皮脐，五灵脂四两，合一处为末，入臼中捣令匀后，蒸饼丸如梧桐子大。空心温酒、盐汤下二十丸，亦治丈夫风疾。又方∶补益元藏，取饮食，壮筋骨。二虎丸∶乌头、附子各四两，酽醋浸三宿，取出切作片子，穿一小坑，以炭火烧令通赤，用好醋三升，同药倾入热坑子内，盆合之，经一宿取出，去砂土，用好青盐四两，研与前药同炒，令赤黄色，杵为末，醋、面糊丸如梧子大。空心冷酒下十五丸，盐汤亦得，妇人亦宜。又方∶疗瘫缓风，手足 曳，口眼 斜，语言蹇涩，履步不正，神验。乌龙丹∶川乌头去脐了，五灵脂各五两，右为末，入龙脑、麝香研令细匀，滴水丸如弹子大。每服一丸，先以生姜汁研化，次暖酒调服之，一日两服，空心、晚食前服。治一人只三十丸，服得五、七丸，便觉抬得手，移得步，十丸可以自梳头。胜金方∶治蝎蜇。乌头末少许，头醋调敷之。灵苑方∶治马汗入疮，肿痛渐甚，宜急疗之，迟则毒深难理。以生乌头末敷疮口，良久有黄水出，立愈。初虞世治陷甲，割甲成疮，连年不瘥。川乌头尖、黄柏等分，为末，洗了贴药。修真秘诀治泻痢。三神丸∶草乌头三两，一两生；一两熟炒；一两烧存性。研为末，以醋、面糊丸如绿豆大。每服五丸，空心服。泻用井花水；赤痢甘草汤下；白痢干姜汤下；赤白痢生姜甘草汤下。孙兆口诀治阴毒伤寒，手足逆冷，脉息沉细，头疼腰重，兼治阴毒咳逆等疾。川乌头、干姜等分，上为粗散，炒令转色，放冷再捣为细散。每一钱，水一盏，盐一撮，煎取半盏，温服。古今录验∶治痈攻肿，若有息肉突出者。乌头五枚，以苦酒三升，渍三日，洗之，日夜三、四度。杨氏产乳疗耳鸣无昼夜。乌头烧作灰，菖蒲等分为末，绵裹塞耳中，日再用，效也。唐·李宝臣为 人置堇于液，宝臣饮之即喑，三日死。唐·武后置堇于食，贺兰氏食之，暴死。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-undy0fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-undy0fi","updated":"20240612164532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶乌头、乌喙、天雄、附子、侧子，凡五等，皆一物也。只以大小、长短、似像而名之。后世补虚寒，则须用附子，仍取其端平而圆，大及半两以上者，其力全不僭。风家即多用天雄，亦取其大者。以其尖角多热性，不肯就下，故取敷散也。此用乌头、附子之大略如此。余三等，则量其材而用之。其炮制之法，经方已着。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164532-p2cxbw2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164532-p2cxbw2"}},{"ID":"20240612164617-gvborm2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164617-gvborm2","updated":"20240612164621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164617-fhaihsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164617-fhaihsj","updated":"20240612164617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十"}]},{"ID":"20240612164617-ap7bmjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164617-ap7bmjb","updated":"20240612164617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名莨，一名千秋，一名毒公，一名果负，一名耿子。神农、雷公、桐君、黄帝∶甘，有毒。正月始生，叶浓，茎方中空，叶四面相当，与蒿相似。乌喙，神农、雷公、桐君、黄帝∶有毒。李氏∶小寒。十月采。形如乌头，有两岐相合，如乌头之喙，名曰乌喙也，所畏恶使，尽与乌头同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164622-fjd0cy9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164622-fjd0cy9"}},{"ID":"20240612164628-sg8e8pt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-sg8e8pt","updated":"20240612164635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-kbn5f4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-kbn5f4i","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味辛温。主中风，恶风，洗洗，出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚，寒热。其汁煎之，名射罔，杀禽兽。一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-2tyn75u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-2tyn75u","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、苦、温，入足厥阴肝、足少阴肾经。开关节而去湿寒，通经络而逐冷痹，消腿膝肿疼，除心腹痞痛。治寒疝最良，疗脚气绝佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-z0ykfaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-z0ykfaw","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头五枚，麻黄三两，甘草三两，黄芪三两，芍药三两。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治历节肿疼，不可屈伸。以湿寒浸淫，流注关节，经络郁阻，故作肿痛。甘草培土，芍药清肝，黄芪行其卫气，麻黄通其经脉，乌头去其湿寒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-tmjxiwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-tmjxiwf","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头赤石脂丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头一分，炮，蜀椒一分，干姜一两，附子半两，赤石脂一两。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治心痛彻背，背痛彻心。以寒邪冲逆，凌逼宫城。赤石脂保其心君，乌、附、椒、姜，驱逐其寒邪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-92hcbpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-92hcbpr","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大乌头煎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"大乌头五枚。水三升，煎一升，去滓，入蜜二斤，煎令水老。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治寒疝，脐痛腹满，手足厥冷。以水寒木郁，不得发越，阴邪凝结，冲突作痛。乌头破寒气之凝，蜜煎润风木之燥也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-metmdz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-metmdz5","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头三枚，桂枝三两，芍药三两，甘草二两，生姜三两，大枣十二枚，蜜二升，煎乌头，减半，去滓，以桂枝汤五合，煎一升。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治寒疝腹痛。以肝肾寒邪，同犯脾土，桂枝补土疏木，乌头破其寒凝也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-2e3ldc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-2e3ldc2","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在朱砂。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治寒气厥逆，以其驱寒而降逆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-uz01gsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-uz01gsj","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头温燥下行，其性疏利迅速，开通关腠，驱逐寒湿之力甚捷。凡历节脚气、寒疝冷积、心腹疼痛之类，并有良功。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164628-lxhf488","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164628-lxhf488","updated":"20240612164628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制同附子，蜜煎，取汁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164629-fa7yi08","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164629-fa7yi08"}},{"ID":"20240612164641-1niebtz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164641-1niebtz","updated":"20240612164645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《顾松园医镜》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164641-b82lqr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164641-b82lqr6","updated":"20240612164641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初种者为乌头，〔即川乌。〕象乌之头也。附乌头而旁生者，为附子，如子附母也。附而长三、四寸者为天雄，功用相同。但附子性重滞，主寒疾∶乌头性轻浮，主风疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164641-2p6ttok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164641-2p6ttok","updated":"20240612164641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"温病、热病、暑病、燥病，俱系热病，万无可用之理；即传经伤寒，亦系热病，与直中阴经不同；仲景诸方，虽有用之，皆为误汗吐下而设，原非正治之法。若东南中风症，皆非真中风寒，俱当远避。阳厥症，虽有肢体尽冷，指甲青黑，自汗发呃，吐蛔下利，身卧如塑，六脉无力，或微或绝，种种似阴，审其内症，必气喷如火，咽干口臭，舌苔芒刺，渴欲饮冷，谵语太息，喜凉恶热，心腹胀满，按之痛甚，小便必黄赤短少，下利必臭秽殊常，误投下咽必毙。至若阴虚内热骨蒸，血液衰少诸病，吐衄肠红崩漏，均为大忌。老人精绝，少年失志，暑月湿热，皆令阳痿，不可误服辛热。能堕胎，孕妇亦大忌之。世徒见疗阳虚气衰，有起死之功，不细审辨、用之，是不操刀而杀人矣，故特着其害，以表其非轻用之药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164641-okzmtm7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164641-okzmtm7"}},{"ID":"20240612164651-17vxwf9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-17vxwf9","updated":"20240612164658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-pney51k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-pney51k","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"制同附子。初种为乌头，象乌之头也。附乌头而生者为附子，如子附母也。乌头如芋魁，附子如芋子，盖一物也。别有草乌、白附，故以黑附、川乌别之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-x1rmijy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-x1rmijy","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，甘，大温，有毒。除诸风风痹风邪，半身不遂之风，祛诸寒寒湿寒冷，坚痞老积之寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-2wpioiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-2wpioiw","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功同附子，助阳之力稍缓，祛风之力则盛。乌头尖吐风痰，治癫痫取其锋锐，无他意也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-jqxveij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-jqxveij","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生犍为山谷及广汉。冬采为附子，春采为乌头。今绵州乃广汉故地。绵州所属彰明所产尤多。盖十一月播种，春月生苗。茎类野艾而泽，叶类地麻而浓。其花紫瓣黄蕤，长苞而圆。其初种之小者为乌头，附乌头旁生者为附子，又左右附而偶生者为乌喙，附而长生者为天雄，附而上出者为侧子。春末生子，故曰春采为乌头。冬月生子已成，故冬采为附子。盖附子乃乌头所生之子也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-48wdqdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-48wdqdr","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腰脚冷痹痛，生川乌为末，醋合敷之。（验方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-hcykpd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-hcykpd4","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"香港脚肿痛久者，生附子为末，姜汁合涂。（第二。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-ygiomxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-ygiomxp","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年久头痛，川乌、南星末、葱汁合敷太阳穴。（第三。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-1y58tlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-1y58tlt","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头风斧劈，川乌末烧烟熏碗中，茶泡服之。（第四。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-hfw26af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-hfw26af","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳鸣不已，生乌头烧末，菖蒲等分，绵包塞之，日易之。（第五。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-8s7l44t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-8s7l44t","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳猝聋醋炙附子，削尖插入耳中。（第六。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-hack862","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-hack862","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手足冻裂，附子为末，合面敷之。（第七。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-ya1m9pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-ya1m9pv","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子 茯苓 白术 人参 白芍治身体骨节俱痛，手足寒，脉沉微。（诸方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-yt3kehw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-yt3kehw","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝 白芍 炙草 姜 枣 附子治因发汗成漏，小便难，四肢急，屈伸不便，恶风。（第二。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-bjm5wf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-bjm5wf0","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"附子泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子 大黄 黄连 黄芩附子煎，三黄用水渍之。治心下痞，恶寒汗出者。（第三。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-oxhpfya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-oxhpfya","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝 附子 甘草 生姜 大枣治骨节痛，小水不利，不渴者。（第四。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-yiha4ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-yiha4ht","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"仙桃丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生乌头 五灵脂 威灵仙酒丸豆大，每酒下七丸，忌茶。治手足麻痹疼痛，或瘫痪疼痛，或腰膝痹痛。（第五。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-msg2mfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-msg2mfr","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姜附汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子 干姜治中寒困昏，脐腹冷痛，霍乱转筋。（第六。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-axofxal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-axofxal","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头煎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头煎去渣，纳蜜再煎。治绕脐寒疝痛，手足冷，自汗脉紧。（第七。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-e9ysoau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-e9ysoau","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"再造散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头 当归 台参 桂枝 川断 乌蛇 甘草 茅术 川芎 羌活 松节牛膝防风治瘫痪。（第八。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-hd3vr1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-hd3vr1h","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小活络丹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（舒筋最宜。） 天麻 白附子 牛膝 木鳖子 羌活（各五钱。） 乌头（一钱）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-sy12i5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-sy12i5r","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地龙（焙） 乳香 没药（各一钱） 朱砂（一钱） 南星（五钱）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164651-05i4ou1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164651-05i4ou1","updated":"20240612164651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酒丸豆大。治两脚无力，小儿不能行，成痿症者。（第九。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164652-o4m6dgd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164652-o4m6dgd"}},{"ID":"20240612164703-ei68tab","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-ei68tab","updated":"20240612164710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-poyeqy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-poyeqy0","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（草乌头．或生用．或炮用．或以乌大豆同煮熟．去其毒用．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-ovf2mnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-ovf2mnw","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-7en0xby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-7en0xby","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温有大毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-nu306c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-nu306c8","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-1fjmuke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-1fjmuke","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中风恶风洗洗出汗．除寒湿痹．咳逆上气．破积聚寒热．其汁煎之名射罔．杀禽兽．消胸上痰冷．食不下．心腹冷痰．脐间痛不可俯仰．目中痛不可久视．又堕胎．主恶风憎寒．冷痰包心．肠腹 痛． 癖气块．齿痛．益阳事强志．治头风喉痹．痈肿疔毒．但草乌头射罔乃至毒之药．若非风顽急疾．不可轻投．药性论言其益阳事．治男子肾气衰弱者．未可遽然也．此类只能搜风胜湿．开顽痰．治顽疮．以毒攻毒而已．岂有川乌头附子补右肾命门之功哉．"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-aaq8d7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-aaq8d7y","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【反】（半复 栝蒌 白芨 贝母 白蔹）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-z1kuhnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-z1kuhnl","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【恶】（藜芦） 伏（丹砂 砒石）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-xiotg4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-xiotg4t","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【忌】（豉汁）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164703-srgraul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164703-srgraul","updated":"20240612164703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【畏】（饴糖 黑豆 冷水能解其毒）"}]},{"ID":"20240612164704-6pt9p1o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164704-6pt9p1o"}},{"ID":"20240612164727-xfgrmu7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164727-xfgrmu7","updated":"20240612164736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164727-qvdlodr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164727-qvdlodr","updated":"20240612164727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即附子之母，功用与附子相同，而力稍缓，其性轻疏，能温脾，逐风治风疾者以此为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164728-en8wj7p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164728-en8wj7p"}},{"ID":"20240612164741-zjfqbcs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612164741-zjfqbcs","updated":"20240612164748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌头《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612164741-5i6nabi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164741-5i6nabi","updated":"20240612164741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气热，味大辛，辛、甘，大热。有大毒。行诸经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164741-spjnu3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164741-spjnu3g","updated":"20240612164741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《象》云∶治风痹血痹，半身不遂，行经药也。慢火炮拆，去皮用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164741-nrhmlj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164741-nrhmlj8","updated":"20240612164741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主中风恶风，洗洗出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚寒热，消胸上痰冷，食不下，心腹冷疾，脐间痛，肩胛痛，不可俯仰，目中痛，不可久视，堕胎。其汁煎之，名射罔，杀禽兽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164741-b5d2orw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164741-b5d2orw","updated":"20240612164741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《液》云∶乌、附、天雄、侧子之属，皆水浸炮裂，去皮脐用之。多有外黄里白。劣性尚在，莫若乘热切作片子，再炒，令表里皆黄，内外一色，劣性皆去，却为良也。世人罕如此制之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612164742-wn3do13","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612164742-wn3do13"}},{"ID":"20240612164743-o2ssqwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612164743-o2ssqwz"}}]}